  "notes": [
    "BPool's swap and gulp code is only exploitable once a fee-on-transfer token is bound, so the controller's bind(STA) is the reset (a market listing); the later setSwapFee only sizes the loss, and setPublicSwap/finalize are trading gates.",
    "Campaign: the same attacker's three drains of the STONK BPool 0xb9eaf49d 45 minutes later. No earlier exploit: the STA pool's 69 earlier gulp() calls are standalone syncs with no outflow.",
    "STA is valued at the attacker's in-transaction Uniswap sale (109.69 ETH for 2.45M STA, which crashed the price), STONK at its later sale (12.00 ETH), and REP v1 at CoinGecko's Augur price; DefiLlama prices the rest."
